WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:06.760
Kwanza, madai bila tarehe na vyanzo hupungua haraka na kuruhusu muhtasari kunakiliwa makubaliano bandia.

2
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:14.993
Pili, kila madai huandika wakati unaofaa, wakati wa kuandika, mfumo, kiwango, upeo, uhakika, na ukoo wa chanzo.

3
00:00:15.333 --> 00:00:23.218
Tatu, kuangalia uthibitisho wa hisabati katika sita huru Lean uthibitisho kernels kuondoa single-compiler vipofu spots kabisa.
